SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agia Triada (Pentecost)\, Negia (Kionio)
LOCATION:Negia\, Ikaria\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The early-season panigiri on the Agios Kirykos side: on Pentecost Sunday the tiny settlement of Negia (Kionio) near Agios Kirykos keeps Agia Triada with a traditional Ikarian feast after the liturgy. Negia also has a small panigiri for Prophet Zechariah on 5 September. Kastanies (Tragostasi) in Raches keeps Agiou Pnevmatos the following day.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ikaria/#negia-panigiri-of-agia-triada-pentecost-negia-kionio
